            <table width="750" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0">
                <tr>
                    <td width="750" class="pageName">
                        <p class="style77">ORGANIZING ICSE</p>
                        <p class="bodyText">For over forty years, the <em>International Conference on Software
                            Engineering (ICSE)</em> has
                            served as a premier forum for the presentation and exchange of the latest research results
                            and practical experiences in
                            software engineering theories, methods, techniques, tools, and practices. To ensure the
                            continued excellence and success of
                            the ICSE conference series, the ICSE Steering Committee (SC), ACM Special Interest Group in
                            Software Engineering (SIGSOFT),
                            IEEE-CS Technical Council on Software Engineering (TCSE), Association for Computing
                            Machinery, Inc. (ACM), and Institute of
                            Electrical and Electronics Engineers (IEEE), incorporated, through its IEEE Computer Society
                            (IEEE-CS) entered into a
                            Memorandum of Understanding (MOU). The purpose of the MOU is to define and clarify the
                            roles, authorities, responsibilities,
                            and key practices of the co-sponsors and the organizers of ICSE. This document also contains
                            <b><em>ICSE Operating Rules and Guidelines</em></b>
                            that constitute significant ICSE corporate knowledge to support ICSE continuity. </p>
                        <p class="bodyText">&nbsp;</p>
                        <p class="bodyText">ICSE Organizational Guidelines</p>
                        <p class="bodyText"></p>
                        <ul style="list-style-type:none;">
                            <li><b><a href="organization/ICSE-Operating-Rules-and-Guidelines-2023.pdf">ICSE Operating
                                Rules and Guidelines 2023 (24 pages pdf document)</a></b></li>
                        </ul>
                        <p class="bodyText">&nbsp;</p>

                        <p class="bodyText">Call for Letters of Interest to Host ICSE 2030.</p>
                        <p class="bodyText"></p>
                        <ul style="list-style-type:none;">
                            <li><b><a href="organization/Call-for-Letters-of-Interest-to-Host-ICSE2030.pdf">Call for
                                Letters of Interest to Host ICSE 2030 (1 page pdf document)</a></b></li>
                        </ul>
                        <p class="bodyText">&nbsp;</p>
                        <p class="bodyText">Other useful documents:</p>
                        <p class="bodyText"><a href="duplicate.html" class="style1">ICSE Duplicate Submission
                            Statement</a></p>
                        <p class="bodyText">ICSE Awards and Plaques (<a href="organization/ICSE-07-MIP.pdf">PDF</a>, <a
                                href="organization/ICSE-07-MIP.ppt">PPT</a>)</p>
                    </td>
